WEBVTT

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:19.580
2525

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.170
A teleportation experiment goes wrong

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:23.930
And test pilot David Jantz

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:25.890
Is rocketed through the center of the galaxy

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:27.980
He discovers an alternate universe

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:30.000
Caught in a life and death struggle against

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.960
The tyrannical armies of Grip, led by Darkstar and his mighty cyborg, Orn.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:44.670
When Chance enters the hole in space, it allows Darkstar and his command ship to enter our universe and gain an oppressive foothold, leaving Orn behind to continue his conquest.

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:51.730
Two teams are formed to battle Grip's legions. On Earth, Dr. Chagall and his team battle Darkstar and his henchmen.

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.050
In the alternate universe, Major Chance leads his rebel band against the evil battalions of Orn.

00:00:57.410 --> 00:01:00.000
Together, they are Macron 1.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:00.870
One, one, one.

00:01:55.370 --> 00:02:00.000
But you miss a lot of the beauty of the Rhine Valley at night.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.820
There are grip agents everywhere.

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:05.820
Magstar team has eluded our radar but has not eluded us.

00:02:05.820 --> 00:02:11.820
My holographic memory circuits indicate that the Rhine Valley in Germany is a suitable arena for your plans.

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:14.820
The past is about to catch up with Jason Templar.

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:24.710
A little information will go a long way, Your Majesty, so I will leave our transgalactic communications link open and you can access my memory circuits anytime you wish.

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:44.970
I haven't been here in years, but it looks like nothing's changed.

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:46.930
Jason hasn't changed a bit.

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:51.080
Hey, listen, Sharky, if you just wanna look, I'll get you some binoculars.

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:55.040
Sharky, you gonna pull the trigger or what? Do it!

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:59.760
If that's our man down there, what's the problem? Do what you're getting paid for!

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:01.640
I was the one hired by Grip.

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:03.970
And I'll make the decisions around here, understand?

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:06.330
Dark Star paid in advance for this hit,

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:09.590
and I, for one, don't want to get him angry at us, all right?

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:12.330
I always finish when I start.

00:03:12.930 --> 00:03:14.590
Then finish it already.

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:16.580
And I work alone.

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:18.520
Hey, take it easy, Sharky.

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:19.960
I wasn't trying to start nothing.

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:22.240
Nobody tells me my job.

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:24.420
Neither you nor Dark Star, got it?

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:28.010
The only reason you're here is because they made me bring you along.

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:30.000
But you can be replaced.

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:33.800
So tell that to your grip friend.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:35.520
His name is Sharky.

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:36.770
He's a mercenary.

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:39.410
He's also a man from Jason Templer's past.

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:43.690
